# What this plugin will not do

The neighbour. Nothing here breaks a rule, and a reader that refused every entry
would pass every leg above without it.

## It is held by something a run reads

Held today. The thing that holds it is `docs/subtitle-format.md`, and the class
that reads this page is `LimitsPageTests`. Recorded in #57.

## It is a decision nobody has built yet

Decided, not yet built. Recorded in #62, which is where the review this page
promises belongs.

